[b]Updating from beta.5:[/b]
Close the game, extract the ZIP into [b]MortalShell2/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/[/b] and overwrite. Keep your [b]CustomShellSystem/state/[/b] folder. Nothing to migrate.

